WEBVTT

00:10:58.785 --> 00:11:03.503
what's going on in my mind
while I do a calculation of this size.

00:11:03.527 --> 00:11:06.807
Now, I have to apologize
to our magician friend Lennart Green.

00:11:06.831 --> 00:11:09.903
I know as a magician we're not supposed
to reveal our secrets,

00:11:09.927 --> 00:11:11.189
but I'm not too afraid

00:11:11.213 --> 00:11:14.096
that people are going to start
doing my show next week, so --

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:15.683
I think we're OK.

00:11:15.707 --> 00:11:16.853
(Laughter)

00:11:16.877 --> 00:11:18.133
(Applause)

00:11:18.157 --> 00:11:20.808
So, let's see,

00:11:20.832 --> 00:11:23.775
let's take a different row of people,
starting with you.

00:11:23.799 --> 00:11:25.976
I'll get five digits:
one, two, three, four.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.318
Oh, I did this row already.

00:11:27.342 --> 00:11:28.761
Let's do the row before you,

00:11:28.785 --> 00:11:31.054
starting with you:
one, two, three, four, five.